5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"We need a structure that is sustainable but doesn't create unnecessary friction. To start, I think we should examine the last year's ledger of outgoings and the sign-up records for mid-year joiners.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"A sensible start, Asuka. To ensure we aren't inadvertently creating a bureaucratic nightmare for our future treasurer, I'll look into the outgoing treasurer's logged hours and the last year's ledger of outgoings as well.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I agree that we should be mindful of the workload. I'll look into the tally of the sign-in sheets and the rota against the attendance record to see how our members are actually engaging.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,It seems we're all very concerned with paperwork. I'll take a look at the weekday turnout since the summer outings and the quieter members at the winter social. Let's see if people actually enjoy being here.,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Takumi,,We can't just guess the numbers like last time. I'm looking into the bank statements on last year's renewals and the last year's ledger of outgoings. We need to know exactly what we have.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"It seems we have a good spread of data. @Jonathan, why do you feel the rota and sign-in sheets are the priority for determining the fee structure? I'm curious if you're looking for a usage-based model.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Jonathan, I suspect Asuka has hit the nail on the head. Are you proposing we charge based on how often a member actually graces us with their presence? A fascinating, if potentially tedious, prospect.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,I simply believe it is helpful to understand the actual patterns of participation. It would be prudent to know who is utilizing the club's resources most frequently before we decide on a fair fee for everyone.,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"Fairness is a lovely sentiment, Jonathan, but tracking every single visit sounds like a chore. I'm more interested in why people are hesitating to show up in the first place. Numbers don't always tell the whole story.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Shunichi, feelings don't pay the bills. If we don't have a clear picture of the money coming in, we're just gambling with the club's future. We need hard facts, not just stories about why people are quiet.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Takumi, while facts are essential, a rigid focus on numbers can alienate members. We must ensure the new structure doesn't make the club feel like a business, or we risk losing the very people who sustain it.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"A delicate balance, indeed. While I appreciate Takumi's pragmatism, we must avoid transforming our social sanctuary into a corporate audit. Logic suggests that a fee structure is only sustainable if the administration of it is manageable.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"I believe we can find a middle ground. By understanding the distribution of activity, we can ensure the burden of support is shared equitably without making the process overly clinical or burdensome for the treasurer.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"Equitably, Jonathan? How noble. But if we make the fee a reward for attendance, we're just adding another layer of calculation to their decision to join us. Let's not overcomplicate a simple membership.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Shunichi, it's not about rewards, it's about survival. If we keep ""simplifying"" things by ignoring the actual costs, we'll end up with nothing. I'm not interested in a corporate audit; I'm interested in not going broke.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Asuka,,Let's move forward with the data we've selected. I hope we can find a solution that maintains the club's welcoming atmosphere while remaining financially viable. I look forward to seeing what the records reveal.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"Indeed. I shall await the revelations of the archives with a mixture of curiosity and a slight dread for the potential paperwork involved. Until then, let us hope the numbers are as cooperative as we are.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
22,1,4,pass,Benjamin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
23,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I believe the data will provide the clarity we need to move forward peacefully. I look forward to sharing my findings with you all in the next round.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
24,1,4,pass,Jonathan,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
25,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,"I'll be the judge of whether the numbers are cooperative. Let's just hope the data actually reflects the mood of the room, rather than just a series of sterile checkboxes. I'm done for now.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
26,1,4,pass,Shunichi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
27,1,4,talk,Takumi,,Fine. Let's just get the data. I'm tired of the talking; I want to see the actual numbers so we can stop guessing and start planning for real.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
28,1,4,pass,Takumi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
