64,3,1,talk,Asuka,,"Option A is the most logical choice. It covers our fixed costs reliably, eliminates the manual calculations for mid-year joiners, and avoids the transactional atmosphere that @Shunichi is concerned about.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,I concur. Option A is the only choice that doesn't treat the treasurer's free time as an infinite resource. Options B and C are merely invitations for administrative chaos and inevitable burnout.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,1,talk,Jonathan,,"I agree. While I initially hoped for a way to address the imbalance of effort, Option A is the most peaceful solution. It avoids conflict and ensures the club's stability without adding undue stress.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,It's almost refreshing to see you all finally come to your senses. Option A is the only one that stops members from treating the club like a vending machine. Let's just pay and play.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,1,talk,Takumi,,"I'm voting for Option A. As long as we set the fee based on the actual ledger costs and not a guess, it's the only way to guarantee we can actually pay the bills.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Asuka,,"Since we are all in agreement, I see no reason to prolong this. Option A protects the club's financial stability while preserving the low-friction environment that allows our members to feel welcome.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,"It is a rare and beautiful thing to find such unanimous agreement in a committee. Let us proceed before someone discovers a new, complicated way to overthink the matter. I vote for Option A.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,2,talk,Jonathan,,"I also vote for Option A. It is the most serene path forward, ensuring our survival while avoiding the friction of constant calculation. It allows us all to return to the quiet enjoyment of our club.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,I'll join the chorus. Option A is the only one that restores the feeling of belonging over the feeling of buying a ticket. I vote for Option A.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,2,talk,Takumi,,I'm voting for Option A too. It's the only way to get the money we need upfront so we aren't just hoping for the best. Let's just make sure the number is right.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Asuka,,"I vote for Option A. It is the most discreet and efficient method, ensuring that membership remains a matter of belonging rather than a series of visible, calculated transactions.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,My vote is firmly for Option A. It is the only rational choice that preserves both the club's solvency and the treasurer's sanity. Let us embrace this elegant simplicity.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,3,talk,Jonathan,,"I vote for Option A. It is the most harmonious choice, providing the stability we need while avoiding the potential for resentment or administrative burden.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,Option A. It's the only way to stop people from treating their attendance like a business decision. Let's get this over with before someone finds a reason to complicate it. I vote for Option A.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,3,talk,Takumi,,"Option A. I've said it already, but I'll say it again: we need the money guaranteed. As long as we use the real numbers from the ledger, this is the only way. I vote for Option A.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Asuka,,The consensus is clear. Option A provides the necessary financial security without compromising the club's welcoming nature or creating an administrative burden. I am satisfied with this outcome.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
